&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.2; text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;If you have any questions before your visit, feel free to reach out. We look forward to welcoming you to our farm!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
